Package: fighteR
Type: Package
Title: Access Combat Sports Data for Boxing and Mixed Martial Arts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Daniel", "Tomaro", 
           email = "daniel.tomaro@icloud.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions to retrieve combat sports data as clean data frames. 
    Covers boxers, events and fight cards from the 'BoxingBook' API, and 
    mixed martial arts schedules and fight cards for the UFC and other 
    promotions from ESPN's public API. These are unofficial endpoints that 
    may change without notice.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://danieltomaro13.github.io/fighteR/, https://github.com/DanielTomaro13/fighteR
BugReports: https://github.com/DanielTomaro13/fighteR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    httr,
    jsonlite
